        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maki Nomiya, Conrad Thomas Lant, Cronos\n- Bands: Pizzicato Five, Venom\n- Albums: Prime Evil\n- Roles: singer, musician, vocalist, bassist\n\nFacts:\n- Maki Nomiya was born on March 12, 1960, and is a Japanese singer and musician.\n- Conrad Thomas Lant was born on January 15, 1963, and is an English musician known by the stage name Cronos.\n- In the late 1980s, Pizzicato Five became internationally famous as a duo of Konishi and vocalist Maki Nomiya after personnel changes.\n- Prime Evil is the sixth studio album by Venom and the first Venom album not to feature bassist and vocalist Conrad \"Cronos\" Lant.",
